  "id": "chemical-dependence",
  "term": "chemical dependence",
  "definition": "Chemical dependence is a state in which a person develops a psychological, and sometimes physical, reliance on a drug. It involves behavioral responses marked by a recurring urge to use the drug to feel its mental effects or sometimes to prevent discomfort when it is absent, and tolerance may or may not occur.",
